The all-in-one AI and communication platform that connects hotels and travelers</h1><p class="as-hero__subtitle">
Unify your traveler communication and boost revenue with AI and humans working together.</p><ul class="as-hero__benefits"><li class="as-hero__benefit">
<svg class="as-hero__check" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true">
<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#FF5722"/>
<path d="M6 11.5l3.5 3.5L16 8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
</svg>
<span><strong>Automate &amp; Reduce Manual Tasks:</strong> Free up your team with autonomous agents that support your travelers 24/7.</span></li><li class="as-hero__benefit">
<svg class="as-hero__check" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true">
<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#FF5722"/>
<path d="M6 11.5l3.5 3.5L16 8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
</svg>
<span><strong>Increase Direct Bookings &amp; Revenue:</strong> Empower your hotel with generative AI and a copilot that convert traveler interactions into revenue.</span></li><li class="as-hero__benefit">
<svg class="as-hero__check" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true">
<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#FF5722"/>
<path d="M6 11.5l3.5 3.5L16 8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
</svg>
<span><strong>Centralized Management:</strong> Manage all your properties, communication channels, human and AI agents, from a single and unified platform.</span></li></ul>
