</span>
</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-swiper-button elementor-swiper-button-prev" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Previous">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="eicon-chevron-left"></i></div><div class="elementor-swiper-button elementor-swiper-button-next" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Next">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="eicon-chevron-right"></i></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d8c8057 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="d8c8057" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-594a06f elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="594a06f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><section class="as-faq"><div class="as-faq__inner"><header class="as-faq__header"><h2 class="as-faq__title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="as-faq__subtitle">Get answers to common questions about our AI solutions for hospitality</p></header><div class="as-faq__list"><details class="as-faq__item" open>
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>What is Asksuite?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>Asksuite is a global leader in AI reservation assistants and omnichannel communication for hotels, resorts, and hotel chains. Voted with 900+ reviews and 98% customer recommended, the highest among all hotel tech companies!</p></div>
</details><details class="as-faq__item">
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>How many hotels use Asksuite?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>More than 5,500 hotels in 80+ countries use Asksuite, with over 147 million travelers served.</p></div>
</details><details class="as-faq__item">
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>What makes Asksuite different from competitors?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>Unlike generic chatbots, Asksuite is built exclusively for hospitality. We combine an omnichannel platform featuring a 23x average ROI, AI reservation assistants, autonomous agents with 2M+ tasks automated, and 400+ booking engine integrations to turn chats into confirmed bookings. Hotels get real-time performance dashboards, transparent ROI tracking, and proven results.</p></div>
</details><details class="as-faq__item">
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>How does Asksuite help increase direct bookings?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>The Asksuite AI Reservation Assistant answers travelers instantly 24/7 on WhatsApp, website, Instagram, and other channels. It understands multiple questions in a single message, responds naturally in 50+ languages, qualifies leads, and sends real-time quotes — turning conversations into confirmed bookings without human intervention.</p></div>
</details><details class="as-faq__item">
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>What is Sophia?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>Sophia is Asksuite's new AI, designed exclusively for hotels. She manages traveler reservations end-to-end, acts as a copilot for human agents with real-time support, and centralizes hotel data into one intelligent hub. With natural communication in 50+ languages, contextual understanding, and seamless system integrations, Sophia helps hotels sell more with less effort. She is the new digital brain of your hotel.</p></div>
</details><details class="as-faq__item">
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>What is AskFlow Agents?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>AskFlow Agents are specialized digital agents that automate critical tasks across the traveler journey, such as cart recovery, booking abandonment follow-ups, personalized promotions, guest surveys, and check-in/out messages. Each agent has a specific role, working 24/7 to reduce manual work, recover lost revenue opportunities, and deliver personalized experiences at scale. They are your hotel's always-on digital team, driving efficiency and growth.</p></div>
</details><details class="as-faq__item">
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>How much does Asksuite cost?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>Pricing depends on your hotel's needs. We offer solutions for properties of all sizes and levels of digital maturity, from independent hotels to large chains. Please contact our specialists to receive a personalized plan tailored to your goals.</p></div>
</details><details class="as-faq__item">
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>What results can hotels expect with Asksuite?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>On average, hotels using Asksuite achieve 23x ROI, and process tens of thousands of bookings through AI support. More than 147 million travelers have already been served, with 2.1 billion messages exchanged across channels. Hotels report higher conversion rates, reduced manual work for reservation teams, and greater guest satisfaction thanks to faster, multilingual, 24/7 service.</p></div>
</details><details class="as-faq__item">
<summary class="as-faq__question">
<span>Why is Asksuite the world's best AI chatbot for hospitality?</span>
<svg class="as-faq__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3.5 5.25L7 8.75L10.5 5.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
</summary><div class="as-faq__answer"><p>Asksuite is the world's best AI Reservation Assistant for the hospitality industry, having been voted the #1 Hotel Chatbot in 2026 for the 7th consecutive year by the Hotel Tech Awards (HTR). This achievement is backed by nearly 1,000 verified hotelier reviews and a 98% recommendation rate. Additionally, Asksuite is ranked among the Top 10 Hotelier's Choice and stands as one of the Top 5 Best Places to Work in the global hotel tech industry, according to HTR.</p></div>
</details></div></div></section><style>.as-faq{background:#F9FAFB;padding:80px 20px}.as-faq__inner{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}.as-faq__header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px}.as-faq__title{font-size:36px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;color:#FF5722;margin:0 0 16px;font-family:"Inter",Sans-serif}.as-faq__subtitle{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1F2937;margin:0}.as-faq__list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.as-faq__item{background:#FFF;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color 0.2s ease,box-shadow 0.2s ease}.as-faq__item:hover{border-color:#D1D5DB}.as-faq__item[open]{border-color:#E5E7EB;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgb(0 0 0 / .04)}.as-faq__question{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 24px;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:#1F2937;font-family:"Inter",Sans-serif;line-height:1.4;list-style:none;user-select:none}.as-faq__question::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.as-faq__question::marker{display:none}.as-faq__chevron{flex-shrink:0;color:#6B7280;transition:transform 0.25s ease,color 0.2s ease}.as-faq__item[open] .as-faq__chevron{transform:rotate(180deg);color:#FF5722}.as-faq__answer{padding:0 24px 20px}.as-faq__answer p{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4B5563}@media (max-width:600px){.as-faq{padding:56px 16px}.as-faq__header{margin-bottom:32px}.as-faq__title{font-size:26px}.as-faq__subtitle{font-size:15px}.as-faq__question{padding:16px 18px;font-size:15px;gap:12px}.as-faq__answer{padding:0 18px 18px}.as-faq__answer p{font-size:14px}}</style></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7fbf9c3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="7fbf9c3" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c743755 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c743755" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="headin